*.pem

# Bot temp files
dxos-tmp
build

# Credentials the user hands to an agent for a task (see AGENTS.md "Handing an agent a
# credential"). Ignored at every depth. An ignore rule is default exclusion, NOT enforcement:
# `git add -f` still stages these, and a path already in the index stays tracked.
.secrets
.secrets/
**/.secrets/

