# moon
.moon/cache
.moon/docker
node_modules

# @dxos/introspect symbol cache (regenerated as needed).
.dxos-introspect/

.superpowers/

# Development fixtures: real, PII-bearing corpora pulled by `moon run fixtures:pull`, plus any
# encrypted archive staged for upload (see tools/fixtures). Never commit.
/testing/fixtures/
*.age

# moon remote-cache mTLS material — never committed (tools/moon-cache/README.md).
.moon/certs/

# Remote-cache benchmark output (tools/moon-cache/bench).
.moon-bench/

# Agentic-review: finalize keeps only REVIEW.md + RESOLUTION.md per run
# (STAGING.md / groups.json / groups/ are deleted on finalize).

# Icon-copy artifact: a misconfigured asset step writes phosphor SVGs to a literal
# "dummy-non-existing-folder" rather than skipping. Generated output, never sources.
dummy-non-existing-folder/
tools/vscode/vscode-mdl/dist

# Generated headless capability barrels (dx-plugin prebuild, produced by plugin prebuild tasks).
**/src/capabilities/gen/
